# Large, regenerable reverse-engineering inputs (see tools/README.md)
*.asm
*.strings
*_x86
*_x86_64
*.thin

# Captured SAML callbacks may contain single-use tokens — never commit
saml_callback*.log
*.token
test_uid

# Rust client build output and any assembled CONNECT bodies (may hold the PSK)
client/target/
*.bin
connect-body.bin

# Local secrets (plaintext PSK, etc.) — never commit
.env
.env.*

# Never commit the FortiClient device key
local.key
**/local.key
*.key
